#!/usr/bin/env python3
# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
"""Dependency-aware Linux kernel backport orchestrator for RPM-oriented trees.

kernel-backporter preserves the useful workflow of the original
centos-kernel-backporter script, but preflights a requested upstream commit in
an isolated clone before touching the user's working tree.

The central safety invariant is deliberately strict:

    The tool may add known upstream prerequisite commits, but it never edits a
    conflicted source file automatically.

When a cherry-pick fails, the orchestrator uses upstream hunk provenance,
Fixes: relationships, downstream provenance, and upstream history to look for
missing prerequisite commits.  It retries only by adding ordinary upstream
commits.  If that cannot make the sequence apply cleanly, it stops and writes
an inspection dossier.
"""

